{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2022-06-13 09:05:00', 'title': 'SYNOPSYS DRIVES CHIP INNOVATION FOR NEXT-GENERATION MOBILE AND HPC DESIGNS ON TSMC N3E AND N4P PROCESSES', 'text': 'SYNOPSYS DIGITAL AND CUSTOM DESIGN FLOWS CERTIFIED FOR TSMC N3E AND N4P\xa0PROCESSES\xa0AND BROAD SYNOPSYS IP PORTFOLIO AVAILABLE NOW MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF. , JUNE 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HELPING CUSTOMERS OPTIMIZE PERFORMANCE, POWER AND AREA (PPA) FOR NEXT-GENERATION SYSTEM-ON-CHIPS (SOCS) USED IN DEMANDING MOBILE AND HIGH-PERFORMANCE COMPUTING APPLICATIONS, SYNOPSYS, INC. \xa0(NASDAQ: SNPS ) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT TSMC HAS CERTIFIED THE SYNOPSYS DIGITAL AND CUSTOM DESIGN FLOWS FOR ITS INDUSTRY-LEADING N3E AND N4P PROCESS TECHNOLOGIES.'}